// Tile configurations for the WKQuantA8 wave64 route on the Flint dense
// projections. Expand with X(id, BM, BN, BK, WM, WN); id 0 replicates the
// shipped wave64 Q8_0 schedule (128x128, BK 2, 2x2 waves) tuned for the
// square Qwen shapes. All variants keep the per-element int32 K-ascending
// accumulation order, so they must be bitwise identical to each other.
X(0, 128, 128, 2, 2, 2)
X(1, 128, 128, 2, 4, 1)
X(2, 128, 128, 2, 1, 4)
X(3, 128, 128, 1, 2, 2)
X(4, 128, 128, 4, 2, 2)
X(5, 64, 128, 2, 2, 2)
X(6, 128, 64, 2, 2, 2)
X(7, 64, 64, 2, 2, 2)
X(8, 64, 128, 1, 2, 2)
X(9, 192, 128, 2, 4, 1)
